WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Show us your tuios setup.

00:02.000 --> 00:03.900
1 of 12. Omarchy style: Tokyo Night, flat numbered tabs, gaps.

00:03.900 --> 00:05.800
2 of 12. Cozy pastel: Catppuccin Mocha in pills, a now-playing pane.

00:05.800 --> 00:07.700
3 of 12. Synthwave: pink to cyan borders, a sunset cover.

00:07.700 --> 00:09.600
4 of 12. Paper: Rose Pine Dawn on cream, thin square lines.

00:09.600 --> 00:11.500
5 of 12. Amber CRT: all sixteen colours amber, double lines.

00:11.500 --> 00:13.400
6 of 12. Forest: Everforest, the editor in the middle.

00:13.400 --> 00:15.300
7 of 12. Scrolling columns: Nord, columns that run off the edge.

00:15.300 --> 00:17.200
8 of 12. Ink: Kanagawa, brush frames and kanji tabs.

00:17.200 --> 00:19.100
9 of 12. Hacker wall: nine live panes, one green.

00:19.100 --> 00:21.000
10 of 12. Zen: one page, nothing else.

00:21.000 --> 00:22.900
11 of 12. Maximal: Gruvbox, a full rail and six panes.

00:22.900 --> 00:24.800
12 of 12. Mono: greys and one warm orange.

00:24.800 --> 00:30.200
The theme editor: a new colour for the accent role, applied at once.

